# Apps `<id> app` knows how to install. One per line:
#   id | category | name | source | what to install | note
# Sources:
#   repo      Arch packages (space-separated)
#   multilib  Arch packages from [multilib]; enables it first, adds the 32-bit GPU driver
#   aur       AUR packages, built with yay
#   gpu       one Arch package per GPU vendor: amd:<pkg> nvidia:<pkg> intel:<pkg> other:<pkg>
#   web       a web app: opens the URL in its own Chromium window
#   agent     a coding agent, installed by `<id> agent install`
# Defaults (installed with the system) are in packages/apps.packages; they are
# marked "default" in the note so `<id> app list` can show them.

